      "content": "I am so sorry you feel that talking about help feels like a band-aid when you are exhausted from endless tasks. The thought that ending it all might be the \"logical\" way to stop the pain is a cry for relief, and I hear the desperation in that wish for the struggle to simply end.\n\nPlease know that your thoughts matter and you are safe to talk about them with a real person who can help you find relief.\n\nI recommend you try to contact a suicide help and suicide prevention facility in your own country.",
